MGU GameStation v0.1.0

This app bundles the following emulator source modules (with module-format
conversion, Node.js 8 compatibility and SNES diagnostic suppression;
see tools/vendor_retro_cores.py for the exact modifications):

1. nes-js, Copyright (c) 2017 Takahiro.
   https://github.com/takahirox/nes-js
   License: MIT (NES_JS_LICENSE.txt).

2. serverboy.js, by Dan Shumway and contributors, based on the GameBoy
   emulator developed by Grant Galitz and others.
   https://github.com/danShumway/serverboy.js
   License: GNU General Public License, Version 2 (SERVERBOY_LICENSE.txt).
   This GameStation app is GPL-2.0 because it incorporates the Serverboy core;
   other standalone apps in this repository are unaffected.

3. jssnes, by deepneko and contributors.
   https://github.com/deepneko/jssnes
   License: MIT (JSSNES_LICENSE.txt).

4. QR Code Generator for JavaScript, Copyright (c) 2009 Kazuhiko Arase.
   https://github.com/kazuhikoarase/qrcode-generator
   License: MIT (QR_VENDOR_LICENSE.txt).

No commercial game ROMs or console firmware are bundled.
The GameStation code, vendor bundles, and bundling scripts are available
in the same source repository as the app for review and redistribution.
